  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="2da54feb-6751-50f1-8f29-f634c4ec5d10" activityNameId="9a011377-c08d-57b1-97aa-f3e263c5a45a" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Evacuated tube collector, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Evacuated tube collector, at plant
The collector has selective TINOX-coating on copper made in DE. ;
Synonyms: VTC, vacuum tube collector; 
UUID: 1aceaa1b-748e-3a8c-b6ba-bb9ce60a3f78
Production of an evacuated tube collector in Northern-Ireland. Including materials and energy use of production. Disposal in CH. Materials for mounting on roof are excluded.
Location: Production in GB. Main components are imported from DE.
Technology: Assembly of an evacuated tube collector. The collector has selective TINOX-coating on copper made in DE. 
Time period: Material data have been investigated for a collector produced in 2002. Data for energy uses during production have been investigated for 2001.
Production volume: In 2009 10'285 m2 of flat plate collectors (7.2 MW capacity) were sold in CH.
Sampling: Questionnaires. 
Extrapolations: Energy uses during production investigated in an other factory for an other type of tube collector.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1aceaa1b-748e-3a8c-b6ba-bb9ce60a3f78.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
